### Get settings
GET https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/dev/daily-dragon/settings
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Update HSK level
PATCH https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/dev/daily-dragon/settings
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hsk_level": 2
}

### Mark placement test completed
PATCH https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/dev/daily-dragon/settings
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "placement_completed": true
}

### Update both fields at once
PATCH https://0xok06khai.execute-api.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/dev/daily-dragon/settings
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "hsk_level": 3,
    "placement_completed": true
}
